              "name": "A specific source format and valid target formats.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"doc\",\n  \"targets\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"docx\",\n      \"credit_cost\": 1\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"pdf\",\n      \"credit_cost\": 1\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```",
